   closeRLM, closeRLM2, closeRLM3, closeRLM4, dumbRLM1, dumbRLM1.2, dumbRLM2, 
   teachRLM, teachRLM2, teachRLM3, turn21, turn22, turn23, 
   naive1, naive2, mixedMod1, mixedMod2, mixedMod3)
